"math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_009_0476b415.png" alt="x equals 10"></span> since <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_010_ff6de586.png" alt="x plus y, equals 20"></span>. However, substituting 10 for both <span class="italic">x</span> and <span class="italic">y</span> in the second equation yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_011_bea7e001.png" alt="70 equals 85"></span>, which is a false statement. Choice C is incorrect. If <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_012_7aa0b8a1.png" alt="y equals 60"></span>, then <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_013_5970dada.png" alt="x equals negative 40 "></span> since <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_014_ff6de586.png" alt="x plus y, equals 20"></span>. However, substituting these values for <span class="italic">x</span> and <span class="italic">y</span> in the second equation yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/cd33b015/img_015_70d01990.png" alt="220 equals 85"></span>, which is a false statement. Choice D is incorrect. If <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/stor